{"id":"absolu","lemma":"absolu","pos":"adj","rank":4669,"glosses":["absolute"],"ipa":"/ap.sɔ.ly/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0a/Fr-absolu.ogg/Fr-absolu.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"absolue","masculinePlural":"absolus","femininePlural":"absolues"},"formAudio":{"absolue":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-absolue.wav","absolus":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-absolus.wav","absolues":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-absolues.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je veux la vérité absolue.","en":"I want the absolute truth.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"truth"},null]},{"text":"Il a un pouvoir absolu.","en":"He has absolute power.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},null]},{"text":"J'ai une absolue confiance en vous.","en":"I have absolute trust in you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"confidence"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Ce n'est pas une règle absolue.","en":"It's not a hard-and-fast rule.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"rule, regulation"},null]},{"text":"Ce sont juste des indications, non des règles absolues.","en":"These are just guidelines, not hard and fast rules.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"fair, just"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"direction, instruction","l":"indication"},{"g":"no"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"rule, regulation","l":"règle"},null]}]}